WEBVTT

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.750
Why am I always the one 
who must suffer so?

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.060
This is a loathsome 
chain that binds me...

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.630
Want me to set you free?

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.060
I'm willing to grant your wish.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.970
Whoa! Nachi?!

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:13.610
Yo! Long time no see.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.290
So you're finally back.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.160
What's with that long hair and beard?

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:20.100
Ignorance

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.790
Well, this is what happens when you 
enjoy retired life for a while.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.870
A spirit hunter?

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:28.380
I heard the rumors while on my way back.

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:32.890
Sounded like their corpses have 
been turning up left and right.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:35.520
These rumors have reached me as well.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.260
But why kill them?

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:41.640
In order to grow more powerful, a 
spirit devours one stronger than itself.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:45.270
The battle of the fittest is hardly 
uncommon amongst their kind.

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:47.280
But that's just it.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.890
This hunter is supposedly a human.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.660
One with a katana.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:54.900
What if Shii was the 
one behind all of this?

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.410
Murasame proudly bears 
the title of "strongest".

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.910
It does not need to 
devour random spirits.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:03.030
Kaede caught wind of 
something rather peculiar.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.660
Apparently

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:09.260
the culprit is a strange man 
who only possesses half a soul.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.790
Keep going! I want the full story!

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.430
About the spirit hunter?

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:19.670
About the guy with only half a soul!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.680
I'm so gonna catch that man this time!

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.520
Wow! You know him, Shii?

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.320
Nope. He's a total stranger.

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:30.740
Where is that man right now?

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:34.060
Dunno. I didn't delve into 
that level of detail.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.950
I've heard about a spirit hunting 
incident in a village in Musashi.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.500
Apparently their regional 
deity was slain;

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.330
the village is beginning 
to fall into ruin.

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:50.080
That man killed their regional deity?

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.090
I don't know what he hopes to gain,

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.180
but it was most likely him.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.350
Throughout these past 
two or three months,

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:58.150
similar incidents have been occurring 
in the neighboring villages.

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.060
Yana Shrine

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:01.730
Although it is uncommon 
for the army to move,

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.900
they have dispatched Genpachi 
Inukai to investigate.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.600
Princess Yana?

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:09.100
Officer Inukai wishes 
to have a word with you.

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:13.730
Oh, Kuma...!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.990
Is he dead?

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.920
Considering his age, it was inevitable.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.830
How may I help you, Officer Inukai?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.380
The regional deity here 
is referred to as "Yana".

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:34.220
I have heard that the 
correct spelling for "Yana"

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:36.260
is written with the character 
for "life" drawn twice.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.210
Yana?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.130
Is that related to your 
name, Princess Yana?

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:43.290
Yana has two lives.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:48.640
We seal one Yana here inside 
this shrine as a living god.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:50.390
It's sealed...?

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.050
Shino!

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.410
I was surprised when I 
received word from Satomi.

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:03.290
I'm impressed you were able 
to travel so far on our own.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.620
I'm not alone!

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.160
Hello, Genpachi.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:10.420
Jeez. I should have expected as much.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:12.390
Did you come to receive Shino?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:14.010
There was that, but I was also

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.330
told that the Imperial Capital 
would be sending reinforcements.

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:20.060
Kobungo, what brings you 
out to the countryside?

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:22.050
That's what I'd like to know!

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:28.930
KONA-YA INN

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.080
Some big-shot officials dropped by

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.620
early this morning and insisted that 
I "rendezvous with Lt. Inukai."

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:32.180
They threw me on the train without 
botherin' to explain the situation!

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:35.710
As one of the sole survivors from 
a unit annihilated by demons,

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:37.090
they have high hopes for you.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.320
What do you mean by that?

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:39.940
I'll explain as we go.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.250
Come along.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.200
Am I gettin' mixed up 
with monsters again...?

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.500
Genpachi!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.950
Don't tell Sosuke about the man

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.330
hunting down spirits and the like!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.850
You haven't told him?

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.640
I think he'll find out 
sooner or later...

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:53.840
Don't tell him!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.590
They seem awfully close 
today, don't they?

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.290
Shino, don't get TOO close!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:05.090
So according to the half of 
Yana that's a living god,

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:09.770
the village is hurting 'cause 
someone killed the regional deity?

00:06:10.270 --> 00:06:11.910
And not just Princess Yana.

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.080
Whenever someone dies,

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:16.550
the villagers insist, "It's 
the regional deity's curse."

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.730
People have died?

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.360
In two weeks, eight people 
have died abnormal deaths.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:24.180
Abnormal deaths...

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:26.860
Was it an illness?

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:29.490
It's not whatever took Otsuka Village.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.750
Supposedly they were torn apart, 
as if attacked by a wild animal.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.800
Is it a bear or somethin' like that?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.300
That's what I thought.

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:40.600
I've tried to ask around, but the

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.880
villagers are extremely cautious 
around me since I'm an outsider.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.810
When I tried to seek assistance 
from the living god,

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:49.940
I was told she only sees 
people once a week.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:52.500
To top it off, she hasn't set foot

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.780
outside of this shrine 
since she was born,

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.030
putting me at a standstill.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:57.500
The shrine?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.940
As Raiki, I'm amazed you could 
get through the torii gate!

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:04.240
Now that you mention it...

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.190
I heard that the Captain of 
the Military Police from the

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:13.410
Imperial Capital asked you 
about Yana this afternoon.

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:14.500
Yes...

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.590
Does he believe the 
rumors about the curse?

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:18.490
I can't say...

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.980
But Yana is dead.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:22.980
That much is certain.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:24.930
He was murdered.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.920
I can tell all too well.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:30.820
But I'm still alive...

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.240
I am sorry, Brother Takanobu.

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:37.680
I... still live...

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.400
Yana, how could you say that?

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.940
Captain Inukai, welcome back!

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.050
Officer Yamamoto, sorry, but please

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:53.430
make arrangements for one more room.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.070
Sir!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.510
There is a sheltered child in the party.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.330
He can't have raw food 
and hates cockroaches.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.240
He's selfish and once 
he leaves, he's gone!

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:02.430
I understand!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.080
Was he talking about me?

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.830
Who else could it be?

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:12.480
If the town's problems are because 
of that dead Yana's curse,

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:15.020
couldn't Princess Yana 
smooth things over?

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:16.160
It's hard to say.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.550
She looked like your typical girl.

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:21.850
Your "typical girl" can't be the 
vessel for half of a regional deity!

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:23.850
Now that the regional deity is dead,

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:27.610
is that girl continuing to 
serve as the living god?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.170
When I tried to gather 
more detailed information,

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.700
the woman guardian started 
to give me a hard time.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:34.610
What guardian?

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:37.100
There are two guardians who have been

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.090
with Princess Yana ever 
since she was born.

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.450
They live in the shrine

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.780
and look after her while 
also managing the shrine.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:46.010
One is a young man named Takanobu.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:48.410
The other is named Saki.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:52.380
I'd say she's five or six years 
older than Princess Yana.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.260
Does she have any parents?

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:57.390
At the very least, they 
don't live in the shrine.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:00.010
At any rate, if you want 
to meet Princess Yana,

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.410
you'll have to wait a week.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:05.800
Those two guardians and 
Princess Yana's dog are

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.020
the only ones allowed to 
see her during the week.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:11.950
But that dog just died this morning.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:13.370
A dog...

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.780
What is it?

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:22.080
Isn't it a pity how we lost Kuma?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.340
I know you were rather fond of him...

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.290
It couldn't be helped.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.520
No matter how much I fawned over him,

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.690
Kuma never did warm up to me.

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:33.960
No one...

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.810
...stays with me...

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.280
Princess Yana?

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:42.810
What could that be?

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.570
Do you think a raccoon dog snuck in?

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:49.190
Kuma?

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.940
No, that's not him.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.230
What's the matter?

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:58.450
Did you get lost?

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.920
You aren't running away.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:09.090
There's no way you could enter the 
shrine's sacred grounds, Genpachi!

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:15.090
Places like that put up crazy strong 
barriers to keep spirits out.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:18.430
Doesn't that mean that 
the living god's duty

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.460
is done now that the regional 
deity, Yana, is dead?

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.110
Infiltration was a success!

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:28.070
Sosuke, good job!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.740
In a while, I imagine Sosuke will come 
back with some fresh information.

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.990
Dang, you guys play dirty...

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:40.360
How strange...

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:43.520
It's amazing how you appeared 
the same day that Kuma died.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:50.320
It pains my good heart to enter a 
young lady's bedroom without reserve.

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:54.310
With such sleek fur, I 
doubt you were a stray.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:59.130
Just as Genpachi said, 
she's a normal girl.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.670
Although I'd be shocked if she 
announced that she's 100 years old.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:06.430
Your master may be out 
looking for you right now.

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:10.850
I will ask Brother Takanobu and 
Saki to search for him tomorrow.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.400
Oh, are you curious?

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:19.900
This is Yana's Seal.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.400
It is the reason why I am here.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:27.970
It is also the chain that binds me...

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:34.540
Do you seriously intend 
to look for that man?

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.420
He may have incurred Keno's wrath,

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.570
but he means nothing to you.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.770
He quit meaning nothin' to me!

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.550
Goodness gracious.

00:11:46.940 --> 00:11:50.970
While Sosuke is away, I 
have to find that jerk

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.760
and get the gem back!

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:54.440
Shino?

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:56.090
Good morning!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:11:59.440
A young man not from around here...

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:02.950
Ah! I think I saw a man like 
that about half a month ago.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.200
One of his eyes was golden...

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.870
He asked, "Where could 
I go to see Yana?"

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:14.110
I thought he meant Princess Yana,

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:17.460
so I told him she's at the shrine.

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:19.480
That's Ao!

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:23.800
According to Genpachi, Yana has 
two lives that make it one whole.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:28.310
If he intends to take all of Yana's 
power, his next target is...!

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:41.360
These are wild deer, but they 
have lived here for a long time.

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.270
Because of that, this is 
also called the Deer Shrine.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:48.550
Some even believe that Yana 
takes the form of a buck.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.210
Hmmm.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:55.720
Truly, it feels as though you 
understand what I'm telling you.

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.970
My answer will be the same no 
matter how many times you come!

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:01.270
We need you to give your approval today!

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.720
There is no way I could force 
that upon Princess Yana!

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:05.170
We've already lost eight!

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:06.960
I can't bear to see another person die!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.440
But my younger sister-

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:10.960
Younger sister? You are a guardian!

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.980
You aren't related to 
Princess Yana by blood.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:16.360
Your real siblings are 
enjoying comfortable lives

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:18.200
because you accepted 
the job as guardians

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.170
when none of the villagers wanted to,

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.930
despite not wanting to yourselves!

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:25.240
Saki, your parents received perfectly

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:28.050
good medical care clear until the end.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.120
So why are you defying our wishes?!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.170
It is not as though we are defying you.

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.370
It's just, Princess Yana is still only-

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:38.300
She's the living god and Yana's bride!

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.360
It's time she carried out her duty!

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.250
The only one who can appease Yana

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.670
and end the curse is his 
bride, Princess Yana!

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:50.050
I already knew...

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.610
I know how they truly feel about me.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.780
All kinds of people come to talk 
to me about so many things.

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:01.520
But no one ever listens 
to what I have to say.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.520
My own parents have never 
once come to see me.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.030
I don't even know when 
my real birthday is.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:15.360
I was born with Yana's Seal and 
confined in this shrine as a living god.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:19.640
If I die, another child 
will be born with the seal.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.900
Whether the child wishes it or not,

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.400
she will become a temporary vessel...

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.270
We'll come back tomorrow!

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:32.140
If you don't agree then, we'll 
take things into our own hands!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.310
Brother Takanobu...

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:37.260
Her duty as a bride?

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.810
That's the same as sacrificing her!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.820
I know all kinds of things.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:48.800
I know that those two only treat 
me kindly because it's their job.

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:53.580
And that I am not the 
one they hold dearest...

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:58.250
I am alone...

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.860
Wow!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:26.930
Check this out! It's a herd of deer.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.110
Maybe I should catch 
one and take it home.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.990
How would you carry it?

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.840
Y-you had to show up!

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:38.180
Don't treat me like 
a ghost or cockroach.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.870
Didn't you want to see me?

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:42.750
That's right! You-

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:44.830
That makes me happy.

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.130
You came all this way for me.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.390
D-dude! Hands off!

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.810
Give Sosuke's gem back!

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:54.390
Oh, you noticed? But 
it's staying with me.

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.570
After all, it originally belonged to me.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:57.640
What?

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:59.330
I am a shadow.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.900
Sosuke and I are two in one.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:05.530
Hard to believe,

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:07.520
considering how the other 
is a far better man!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:08.750
Keno!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:12.230
I heard rumors of a man hunting spirits.

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:14.780
I thought it might be you.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.530
And it looks like I was right!

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:19.040
You really are persistent.

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.660
This comes to an end today!

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:26.960
Wait, Keno!

00:16:28.390 --> 00:16:29.210
I won't let you escape!

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.130
Knock it off, Keno!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.090
Back off, Shino!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.970
I'm not done talking to him!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:39.740
Shino?

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:42.890
Wha-?!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:52.580
W-wait...

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:55.780
You've declared me your 
enemy, haven't you?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.660
That's right! You stole...

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:01.820
everything from me!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:03.970
What a joke.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:04.670
What?

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.670
I'm the one who should 
be saying that to you.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:13.550
Your parents stole everything from us.

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:18.010
I was originally supposed to inherit 
Ochiba... along with Ozasa,

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.980
which is in your possession.

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:24.990
I will take back everything 
that was stolen from me...

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.690
everything.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:30.790
Captain Inukai, it's horrible!

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:31.750
What is it?

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.910
It happened... It happened again!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.950
It really is the regional deity's curse.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:37.400
Were there fatalities?

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:40.450
Yessir. This time someone even 
saw the shape of the culprit.

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:41.760
The shape?

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.460
Supposedly it vanished 
in the blink of an eye,

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:48.260
but he said it looked like 
Princess Yana's seal!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:50.470
Sosuke!

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:52.980
Keno?!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.150
Is Sosuke in?

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:04.170
It's almost as if her spirit 
has left her body, isn't it?

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:19.600
Yana's Seal...

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:23.830
And now there is the 
strong smell of blood...

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:25.770
Princess Yana!

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:30.610
Someone claiming to be the 
dog's owner just arrived.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.680
Apparently he is an acquaintance 
of Captain Inukai's.

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:34.900
I see...

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.890
What a selfish dog!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:43.670
It ran off as soon as 
I mentioned its master.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:44.820
I don't mind.

00:18:45.410 --> 00:18:48.140
After all, everyone is bound 
to leave me eventually...

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:50.150
Princess Yana...?

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.770
I can't blame him for running away.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:56.460
Why do I smell so strongly of blood?

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:05.300
Are you awake?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:17.300
Yana Shrine

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.590
Sosuke!

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:17.300
Sosuke! Shino-! Shino-!

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:15.270
Did something happen?

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.300
That man kidnapped Shino!

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:18.840
It's horrible!

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:18.840
Shino was taken?!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.300
And who do you mean by "that man"?

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.190
Hasn't he told you about him?

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:27.130
Jerk! Did you leave Keno back there?

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:29.380
That man has the Demon Princess' heart.

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.310
It'll take more than that to kill him.

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:33.190
You knew?

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.890
I know everything that 
happens around you.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.900
You're the one hunting 
spirits, aren't you?

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:42.940
Were you also the one who 
killed the regional deity?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.090
Just its vessel.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:46.050
Its vessel?

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:49.200
Each of the two Yana possesses 
their own vessels.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.270
One goes to the princess.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:54.030
The other went to a massive buck.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:57.960
If you killed its vessel, 
where is Yana now?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.010
It's present...

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:01.470
...in here.

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:10.350
Shino, what are you 
trying to hide from me?

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.460
A man who looks just like me?

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.730
Shino told me that he was coming to

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.480
check on the village under 
Mr. Satomi's instructions,

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.420
but that man may have been 
his real reason for coming.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.290
And he left me in the dark...

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:26.040
Keno?

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:27.620
Take it with you.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.740
He called himself your shadow.

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:35.440
And he also claimed that he was 
originally supposed to inherit Ozasa.

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:41.380
If that is true, then you have 
just as much right to this katana.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.790
Be careful.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.330
At the very least, he isn't human.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.660
What are you trying to 
accomplish by yourself?

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:54.470
When I obtain the other seal,

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:57.150
Yana will become whole and awaken.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.780
Are you going to kill

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:01.180
the vessel in the shrine, 
just like you did the buck?

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:02.790
That won't be necessary.

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:07.230
The other Yana is absolutely exhausted.

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:11.120
It has been trapped in a 
small shrine for a long time.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:14.140
It has gone through one 
vessel after the next,

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.850
granting human wish upon human wish.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.220
No wonder it's beat.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.670
It has probably reached its limit.

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:22.280
What do you mean?

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.340
The more it fulfills human desires,

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:27.060
the more it chisels away 
at its human vessel's life.

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:32.450
Eventually Yana will devour 
its vessel's life and body,

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.790
at which point it will be 
released from the shrine.

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:38.150
I simply have to wait 
for that to happen.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.440
And then?

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:42.940
After obtaining that power,

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.540
what do you hope to accomplish?

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.290
Sosuke!

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:40.940
In Homage

00:23:27.060 --> 00:23:29.310
What's Shino searchin' 
so frantically for?

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:31.610
Supposedly something important 
was taken from him.

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:32.300
Somethin' important?

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.150
Shino! Don't tell me Shino lost his-

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:36.680
Don't you dare finish that sentence!

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:38.780
But this is important...

00:23:38.780 --> 00:23:40.350
Hurry off to work!
